    "Do not delete forbidden_actions",
    "Queue created is not task executed",
    "No trace/audit -> no handoff acceptance"
  ],
  "critical_assertions": [
    "H00 is a phase controller, not a report summarizer",
    "H00 queues and hands off, but does not execute downstream business tasks",
    "Different downstream targets require different handoff packets"
  ],
